, 'description': Value('string')}, 'L': {'type': Value('string'), 'description': Value('string')}, 'one': {'type': Value('string'), 'value': Value('int64'), 'description': Value('string')}}\nL136: Need help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review cite39†how to configure the dataset viewer , and cite40†open a discussion for direct support.\nL137: \nL138:   * cite41†Structure L139:   * cite42†Contents L140:   * cite43†Scope L141:   * cite44†Download L142:   * cite45†Usage L143:   * cite46†Archived v0 Dataset L144: # AccRL Training Data\nL145: \nL146: Kernel optimization problems for AccRL training and evaluation. This dataset is curated around GEMM, MHA, MHA backward, FP8 MHA/FP8 GEMM, GQA/MLA attention, RMSNorm, sampling, and GDN problems. Attention workloads in this light shard keep only the 4096 sequence-length case; the larger non-4096 attention payload is staged separately for `AccRL/accrl-training-heavy`.\nL147: ## Structure\nL148: \nL149:     `definitions/{op_type}/{name}.json   # Definition with reference code\nL150:     workloads/{op_type}/{name}.jsonl    # Workload traces, one JSON object per line\nL151:     blob/workloads/{op_type}/{name}/     # Tensor payloads for safetensors workloads\nL152:     solutions/{op_type}/{name}/          # Baseline or reference solutions, when present\nL153:     `\nL154: ## Contents\nL155: op_type  | definitions  | workload files  | workload rows  | blob files  | solution files  | notes\nL156: --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nL157: attention  | 18  | 18  | 18  | 12  | 8  | MHA with LSE, FP8 MHA with LSE, and MHA backward variants; only `S/L=4096` rows\nL158: gemm  | 27  | 27  | 475  | 11  | 0  | bf16 GEMM and local FP8 GEMM tasks\nL159: gdn  | 6  | 6  | 403  | 403  | 6  | FlashInfer-backed GDN decode, prefill, and MTP tasks\nL160: gqa_paged  | 23  | 23  | 504  | 504  | 23  | Paged GQA decode and prefill tasks\nL161: gqa_ragged  | 6  | 6  | 106  | 106  | 6  | Ragged GQA prefill tasks\nL162: mla_paged  | 2  | 2  | 85  | 85  | 2  | Paged MLA decode and prefill tasks\nL163: mla_ragged  | 1  | 1  | 20  | 20  | 1  | Ragged MLA prefill task\nL164: rmsnorm  | 11  | 11  | 102  | 14  | 11  | RMSNorm and fused add RMSNorm tasks\nL165: sampling  | 12  | 12  | 964  | 964  | 12  | Top-k, top-p, and combined sampling tasks\nL166: Total: 106 definitions, 2,677 workload rows, 2,119 safetensors blob files, and 69 solution files.\nL167: ## Scope\nL168: \nL169: This dataset keeps:\nL170: \nL171:   * GEMM eval candidates from the current AccRL bf16/FP8 conventions.\nL172:   * MHA eval candidates, including `mha_with_lse_*`, `fp8_mha_with_lse_*`, and `mha_bwd_*`, filtered to the 4096 sequence-length workload.\nL173:   * GDN tasks with FlashInfer baseline wrappers.\nL174: \nL175: ## Download\nL176: \nL177:     `hf download AccRL/accrl-training \\\nL178:       --repo-type dataset \\\nL179:       --revision main \\\nL180:       --local-dir ./data/accrl-training\nL181:     `\nL182: ## Usage\nL183: \nL184:     `from flashinfer_bench.data import TraceSet\nL185: \nL186:     ts = TraceSet.from_path(\"path/to/this/dataset\")\nL187:     definition = ts.get_definition(\"mha_with_lse_d128\")\nL188:     traces = ts.get_traces(\"mha_with_lse_d128\")\nL189:     `\nL190: ## Archived v0 Dataset\nL191: \nL192: The pre-cleanup dataset card and non-target payload files are available in:\nL193: \nL194:     `hf download AccRL/accrl-training-v0 \\\nL195:       --repo-type dataset \\\nL196:       --local-dir ./data/accrl-training-v0\nL197:     `\nL198: \nL199: Copy to bucket new\nL200: \nL201: Downloads last month\nL202: \nL203:     113\nL204: \nL205: Total file size:\nL206: \nL207: 38.9 GB\nL208: \nL209: System theme\nL210: \nL211: Company\nL212: \nL213: cite47†TOS cite48†Privacy cite49†About cite50†Careers†apply.workable.com L214: \nL215: Website\nL216: \nL217: cite0†Models cite1†Datasets cite2†Spaces cite6†Pricing cite4†Docs -----------------------------------