 in Data Studio L94: \nL95: * * *\nL96: \nL97:   * Previous\nL98:   * cite45†Next L99: # PTXBench Qwen3.6-27B SFT datasets\nL100: \nL101: This private repository contains the byte-exact parquet files used to train PTXBench Qwen3.6-27B-s0 through Qwen3.6-27B-s6. Load one release as:\nL102: \nL103:     `from datasets import load_dataset\nL104: \nL105:     dataset = load_dataset(\"Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-SFT\", \"s0\", split=\"train\", token=True)\nL106:     `\nL107: Config  | Internal recipe  | Scope  | Template  | Reasoning synthesizer  | Rows  | SHA-256\nL108: --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nL109: s0  | `sft-v4`  | 8ops-Extended  | KernelGen  | GLM-5.2  | 494  | `5416899bf9f8312e1e5361dc12f20613246ef597f073852224c81eb314c10ff8`\nL110: s1  | `fixit-v2-glm`  | 4ops  | Fixit  | GLM-5.2  | 158  | `6a42a93125cc8c6dfc0bb52ec1c807e0e6b39fd8f04c43300d82f82ad866d4de`\nL111: s2  | `fixit-v2-glm-8turns`  | 4ops-Extended  | Fixit  | GLM-5.2  | 259  | `06d78bfa4c6f68ec73d7f8d57df4eb31c2a946d1915edfa1c19202e7b74448b1`\nL112: s3  | `fixit-v4`  | 8ops-Extended  | Fixit  | GLM-5.2  | 406  | `8aa2bf4f4c34e542bcc13c66f16e18f51d0da20426823108c8d9778c0002b0b8`\nL113: s4  | `fixit-v5`  | 8ops-Post-balanced  | Fixit  | GLM-5.2  | 170  | `eeda2fa32ded94675fa8b800b3a7be110d79eec195945e836d9141c11f4b3664`\nL114: s5  | `fixit-v5-full`  | 8ops-Pre-balanced  | Fixit  | GLM-5.2  | 258  | `e59150ed81e28edf92710f06760a77077d54d588a3b85ec8d641d52dca5f33d5`\nL115: s6  | `fixit-v6`  | 8ops-Pre-balanced  | Fixit  | Qwen3.6-27B  | 258  | `55122991454816ab51ffbc10d5be2547bb7000b44e8f4df93aa7804a67a60689`\nL116: The parquet `metadata` column retains historical machine-local paths because these are the exact training artifacts. Those paths are provenance strings and are not required to load or train on the `messages` column.\nL117: \nL118: The s0 rows contain `system`, `user`, and `assistant` messages. The s1-s6 Fixit rows contain `system`, `user`, `assistant`, `user`, and `assistant` messages, with only the final assistant message carrying loss mask 1.\nL119: All seven runs used `Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B`, five epochs, learning rate `4.65e-4`, maximum length 65,536, and LoRA rank 32. See `manifest.json` for exact artifact and checkpoint provenance.\nL120: \nL121: These data contain generated reasoning and CUDA kernels. Repository access is private; no public redistribution license is asserted by this card.\nL122: \nL123: Copy to bucket new\nL124: \nL125: Use this dataset\nL126: \nL127: Downloads last month\nL128: \nL129:     53\nL130: \nL131: Number of rows:\nL132: \nL133: 2,003\nL134: \nL135: Total file size:\nL136: \nL137: 68.9 MB\nL138: ## Models trained or fine-tuned on Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-SFT\nL139: \nL140: cite46†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s0 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 6 L141: \nL142: cite47†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s6 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 6 L143: \nL144: cite48†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s3 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 5 L145: \nL146: cite49†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s5 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 5 L147: \nL148: cite50†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s4 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 4 L149: cite51†Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-s1 Image-Text-to-Text • Updated Jul 30 • 4 L150: \nL151: cite52†Browse 7 models trained on this dataset L152: ## Collection including Genghan/PTXBench-Qwen3.6-27B-SFT\nL153: \nL154: cite53†PTXBench Qwen3.6-27B SFT Series Collection Private collection of the exact s0-s6 training parquets and final PEFT adapters used by the PTXBench Qwen3.6-27B SFT series. • 11 items • Updated Aug 19 L155: \nL156: System theme\nL157: \nL158: Company\nL159: \nL160: cite54†TOS cite55†Privacy cite56†About cite57†Careers†apply.workable.com L161: \nL162: Website\nL163: \nL164: cite0†Models cite1†Datasets cite2†Spaces cite6†Pricing cite4†Docs --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPTXBen